      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLEAN ENGINES (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (30.94) in a Mix 5 at Q Parklands. Solid record here winning four races. Yet to taste defeat from three runs out of this box. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. CASH ON DEMAND (2) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when third (30.75) over 520m at Q Parklands. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from six starts. Overdue and gets his chance. PROFESSOR NESSA (3) jumped from this box and went down narrowly when a nose second (30.28) in a Mix 5 at Q Parklands over 520m latest. Should be in this for a long way. MR FRESH (8) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
